      "text": "\tYou will enjoy rafting and going off 6 waterfalls on special inflatable tires.\n\n\tAnd then you will have another adventure- the Arvorismo-Cabanas zipline, located over 6 km from Bonito-MS, Cabanas tour happens on a circuit with 18 obstacles and 2 ziplines, one of them is az zipline on the Rio Formoso with a possibility to land into the river! The tour has a security system with a continue lifelineto which the visitor will be always connected while passing the obstacles.\n\n\tAt Cabanas Canopy tour visitors will have the opportunity to enjoy the view from the treetops while passing different obstacles. "
    },
